[TECHNICAL_REQUIREMENT]
UID: L3-ANS-020
TITLE: Storage pool selection
STATEMENT: >>>
The qube module shall place a qube's volumes in the declared storage pool.
<<<
EARS_PATTERN: Ubiquitous
PRODUCT: Ansible
STATUS: Not Implemented
DEFECT: >>>
There is no pool parameter, and volume enforcement recognises only ``size`` and
``revisions_to_keep`` while silently ignoring any other key
(qubes-ansible/ansible_collections/qubesos/core/plugins/module_utils/qubes_module_qube.py:382).
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: L2-STORAGE-03
